-- one bracket of eq. 61 from doubled spins: each factor (x+y+A+2), (y+A−x), (x+A−y), (x+y+2−A) is twice the
-- factor in spins, and even wherever x, y, A satisfy the triangle rule, so each is halved before the product
vol-tri4 : Nat → Nat → Nat → Nat
vol-tri4 x y A = times (times (nat-half (plus (plus x y) (plus A 2))) (nat-half (monus (plus y A) x))) (times (nat-half (monus (plus x A) y)) (nat-half (monus (plus (plus x y) 2) A)))
